  @bakery-product: Product details screen of a bakery website for a sourdough loaf, with description and an add to cart button (not made yet)
  @bakery-checkout: Checkout screen of a small bakery website with 2 sourdough loaves in the order and a pickup time selector (this screen)

Design it for a phone screen, 390 px wide.

