This screen belongs to a clickable mockup of: A tiny bakery website

Show this screen: Cart screen of a small bakery website with 2 sourdough loaves and 1 croissant

Screens of this mockup, as a tree:
@home: the first screen of A tiny bakery website
  @bakery-menu: Menu screen of a small bakery website listing breads, pastries and cakes with prices
  @bakery-checkout: Checkout screen of a small bakery website with 2 sourdough loaves in the order and a pickup time selector
  @bakery-cart: Cart screen of a small bakery website with 2 sourdough loaves and 1 croissant (this screen)
  @bakery-account: Account screen of a small bakery website showing a customer profile and past orders (not made yet)
  @bakery-product: Product details screen of a bakery website for a sourdough loaf, with description and an add to cart button (not made yet)

Design it for a phone screen, 390 px wide.

Design this as a clearly different alternative to the obvious layout: arrange this screen's content another way, not just the wording.

